.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK WORK LINK DELETE"
.SH NAME
hamstik work link delete \- Delete a link by id
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik work link delete [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Delete a link by id
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I KEY
Work item key
.TP
.I LINK_ID
Link id (UUID)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
